  "notes": "Board silkscreen spellings that differ from the name boxes (Rst, 24, 25, MO, MI, 4, Bat, USB, 13...5) put first in functions. Silkscreen H/L on the CAN terminal put first. CAN controller signals (CAN_*), BUTTON (GPIO7), NEOPIXEL (GPIO21) and NEOPIXEL_POWER (GPIO20) have no physical wiring position; battery connector (GND/VBAT) skipped as battery-only."
